Call for Papers

Dear Scientists and Colleagues,
we would like invite you for submission your research to Scientific Virtual 
Conferences. The Virtual Conference is a new type of scientific event, where 
the most of conversation takes place in a text chat, which is prepared for 
each accepted article separately at the conference portal. 

All participants will receive, when the conference is finished: 
* DVD with the conference materials with an ISBN and ISSN numbers.
* All authors and Reviewers will obtain a Conference Certificates. 

Accepted papers will be submitted for evaluation into SCOPUS and other major 
indexing databases.
We would like to create high-quality scientific conferences and place for 
members of the scietific community to share ideas among each other.

We are currently preparing the following conferences:
*******************************************
HASSACC 2013 (November 18-22, 2013)
Humanities Sciences at the Common Conference
www.hassacc.com
Registration & Submission Deadline: October 18, 2013
*******************************************
RCITD 2013 (November 18-22, 2013)
International Virtual Research Conference In Technical Disciplines
www.rcitd.com
Registration & Submission Deadline: October 18, 2013
*******************************************
ARSA 2013 (December 2 - 6, 2013)
Advanced Research in Scientific Areas
www.arsa-conf.com
Registration & Submission Deadline: November 4, 2013
*******************************************
QUAESTI 2013 (December 16 - 20, 2013)
The 1st Virtual Multidisciplinary Conference
www.quaesti.com
Registration & Submission Deadline: November 18, 2013
*******************************************

Confidence of articles is maintained during the reviewing.
All submitted papers should be written in English. Each paper will be 
reviewed by at least 2 reviewers.

If you have any question about Virtual conference, please do not hesitate to 
contact us. We are looking to see you at our Virtual Conference Event.

